  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only multiprofile model using scgpt encoder with transformer aggregation, achieving a validation accuracy of 0.5136 and F1 of 0.498, lower than the scvi_n200 encoder's performance (0.653 accuracy) in the same setting. This suggests the scgpt encoder may underperform compared to scvi_n200, though the exact impact of encoder choice versus other factors remains uncertain."
